t on top, scot free? Is he completely irredeemable?\u00a0&quot;And little does everyone know about his twisted plan.&quot;</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121930/extras/a7910c62d9c647a5de6c3ce404d35182.poster.avif?t=1750741692\" width=672 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121930/extras/a7910c62d9c647a5de6c3ce404d35182.webm?t=1750741692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121930/extras/a7910c62d9c647a5de6c3ce404d35182.mp4?t=1750741692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study your targets/prey</strong>: Is she hot? What\u2019s her weakness? Does she deserve it? Choose who to spend time with in order to learn more about your prey. Any piece of information will be crucial to reach your objective. They won\u2019t see it coming! Hopefully you won\u2019t have to deal with their problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take photos:</strong> The next step is to take compromising photos without their knowledge. Boobs, ass, thighs or maybe during a more private time? But not only dirty photos, remember, in this line of work you have to be flexible. What will you get? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3121930/extras/f2d83202d1b3274419aae95086abf654.avif?t=1750741692\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackmail</strong>: Those photos aren\u2019t only for show! With enough dirt it will be time to show your true colors and push them into a corner. This is a rapist principle, is what separates a man from an animal. Make sure you have enough material, or else\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjo